---
import Arrow from './Arrow.astro';
---
<figure class="file-diagram hero-concept">
  <div role="img" aria-label="Protected file fragments and protected key components are separate. Both are required for authorized Cyber Reliant reconstruction to produce a readable file. Conceptual view of the upcoming network architecture.">
    <div class="diagram-top"><span><i class="status-dot"></i> CONCEPTUAL ARCHITECTURE</span><span>FIG. 01</span></div>
    <div class="overview-body">
      <div class="overview-inputs">
        <div class="overview-input overview-files">
          <div class="overview-fragments" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
          <strong>PROTECTED<br/>FILE FRAGMENTS</strong>
        </div>
        <div class="overview-input overview-keys">
          <div class="overview-key-components" aria-hidden="true"><span>◇</span><span>◇</span><span>◇</span></div>
          <strong>PROTECTED<br/>KEY COMPONENTS</strong>
        </div>
      </div>
      <svg class="overview-connectors" viewBox="0 0 600 54" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M150 0V52M450 0V52" fill="none" stroke="#809b76" stroke-width="1"/><path class="flow-line" d="M150 0V52M450 0V52" fill="none" stroke="#d3ef74" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="5 55"/></svg>
      <div class="reconstruction-gate"><span>AUTHORIZED CYBER RELIANT</span><strong>RECONSTRUCTION</strong><small>Both inputs required</small></div>
      <div class="overview-output"><span aria-hidden="true">↓</span><svg width="32" height="38" viewBox="0 0 44 52" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2h19l12 12v36H8zM27 2v13h12M15 25h17M15 32h17M15 39h10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg><strong>READABLE FILE</strong></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="overview-caption"><span>Conceptual view · Network architecture upcoming</span><a href="/technology#network">Explore the architecture <Arrow/></a></figcaption>
</figure>
